//@version=6
//=============================================================================
// CTS Alpha
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Version : v0.9.12
// Commit  : 0039.0 - Patch 4
// Stage   : Task 008.4 - Final Execution Decision
//
// Description:
// CTS Alpha Trading Framework - Entry Engine V4 Integration
//
// Changes Patch 4 (2026-08-11):
// - Upgraded Execution Guard to V1 architecture (Task 008.1)
// - Retained legacy executionGate ALLOW/BLOCK interface for Trade Setup compatibility
// - Added semantic executionState: APPROVE / CONDITIONAL / WAIT / BLOCK
// - Exposed independent Decision / Direction / Structure / Risk / Entry gate states
// - Added gate pass-count diagnostics without changing existing scoring formulas
// - Promoted Entry Location Intelligence to Execution Gate V1 (Task 008.2)
// - Promoted Risk Intelligence to Execution Gate V1 (Task 008.3)
// - MEDIUM RISK is CONDITIONAL; HIGH RISK / AVOID are BLOCKED
// - Added Final Execution Decision arbitration across all five gates (Task 008.4)
// - Only APPROVE / ALLOW can reach Trade Setup generation
// - Preserved Entry Engine V4 and Risk Engine scoring formulas
//
//// Changes Patch 2 (2026-08-11):
// - Upgraded Entry Engine V3 → V4
// - Replaced Position Quality with Entry Location Intelligence
//   - Old: Position Quality (EMA-based) 20%
//   - New: Entry Location Score (Structure-based) 25%
// - Updated Entry Quality V4 weights:
//   - Trend Quality        25% → 20%
//   - Pullback Quality     25% → 20%
//   - Location Quality     NEW → 25%
//   - Momentum Quality     15% (unchanged)
//   - Context Alignment    15% → 20%
// - Entry State now includes Location protection:
//   - Requires entryLocationScore >= 70 for IDEAL ENTRY
//   - Requires entryLocationScore >= 50 for GOOD ENTRY
//   - entryLocationScore < 50 → "WAIT BETTER PRICE"
// - Retained entryPositionScore for Risk Engine compatibility
// - Added Entry Quality V4 debug display
// - Prevents chasing extended prices
// - Fixed variable dependency order:
//   - Entry Location Engine now BEFORE Entry Score Calculation
//   - Correct order: engineEntryPrice → entryLocationScore → engineEntryScore
//
// Changes Commit 0034.1:
// - Fixed Decision Explain Engine priority order
//   - Trade Mode Stage Reasons now evaluated BEFORE Breakout Missing
//   - This fixes PULLBACK + WATCH showing "Waiting Breakout" instead of
//     "Waiting Momentum Confirmation"
// - Added Next Action for "Waiting Momentum Confirmation"
//   - Now displays "Wait Momentum Recovery" instead of "Monitor Breakout"
// - Updated priority order:
//   1. Range Market
//   2. Direction Neutral
//   3. Trend Too Weak
//   4. Entry Quality Too Low
//   5. Trade Mode Stage (WATCH / READY)
//   6. Breakout Missing (only if NOT in Pullback Mode)
//   7. Confidence Too Low
//   8. Structure Direction Conflict
//
// Changes Commit 0034.0:
// - Added decisionStage variable (WAIT / WATCH / READY)
// - Renamed pullbackMode → pullbackSetup (represents "opportunity exists")
// - Added pullbackReady (pullbackSetup + Impulse≥40 or Momentum≥60)
// - Renamed breakoutMode → breakoutReady
// - Modified Trade Mode Selection V2:
//   - BREAKOUT: READY
//   - PULLBACK + Momentum/Impulse: READY
//   - PULLBACK + No Momentum: WATCH
//   - NONE: WAIT
// - decisionApproved now uses decisionStage == "READY"
// - decisionReason now displays stage-specific reasons:
//   - PULLBACK + WATCH → "Waiting Momentum Confirmation"
//   - PULLBACK + READY → "Trend Pullback Setup"
//   - BREAKOUT + READY → "Breakout Confirmation"
//   - NONE → "Waiting Setup"
// - Dashboard added Decision Stage display
//
// Changes Commit 0033.1:
// - Added Trade Mode Engine (Pullback / Breakout / None)
// - Added Trade Mode Conditions (pullbackMode, breakoutMode)
// - Modified Decision Engine to use Trade Mode
// - decisionApproved now uses pullbackMode or breakoutMode
// - decisionReason now displays Trade Mode specific reasons
// - Dashboard shows Trade Mode display
//
// Changes Commit 0033.0:
// - Added Execution Guard Engine (Task 008.1)
//   - Default BLOCK, only ALLOW after all conditions pass
//   - 5 gates: Decision, Direction, Structure, Risk, Entry
// - Modified Trade Setup Engine
//   - executionAllowed now uses executionGate == "ALLOW"
//   - Complete flow: Decision → Gate Arbitration → Guard → Trade Setup
// - Added Dashboard Display for Execution Gate
//   - Execution Gate: ALLOW / BLOCK
//   - Gate Reason: Block reason or All Conditions Passed
//
// Changes Commit 0032.0:
// - Added Structure Direction Alignment Engine (Task 007.3.2.1)
//   - Evaluates consistency between market structure and trade direction
//   - Bull Structure + LONG = ALIGNED (100)
//   - Bear Structure + SHORT = ALIGNED (100)
//   - Bull Structure + SHORT = CONFLICT (25)
//   - Bear Structure + LONG = CONFLICT (25)
// - Modified Execution Quality formula
//   - Entry 50% → 40%
//   - Risk 30% → 25%
//   - Direction Quality 20% (unchanged)
//   - Structure Alignment 15% (new)
// - Added Structure Alignment display in Dashboard
// - Reduced execution confidence during structural conflict
//
// Changes Commit 0031.0:
// - Direction Adaptive Entry Price Engine (Task 007.3.2)
//   - LONG: Entry = StructurePrice - Adjustment (buy pullback)
//   - SHORT: Entry = StructurePrice + Adjustment (sell rally)
//   - NEUTRAL: Entry = StructurePrice (no adjustment)
// - Entry Engine → Trade Setup Integration (Task 007.3.3)
//   - tradeEntryPrice now uses engineEntryPrice instead of close
//   - Complete integration: Decision → Entry → Trade Setup → Risk
//
// Changes Commit 0030.0:
// - Added Structure Entry Price Engine
// - Added engineEntryPrice calculation based on EMA20 + EMA60 midpoint
// - Added price adjustment based on Position Score
// - Added Entry Price display in Dashboard
//
// Patch 1 (2026-08-11):
// - Added Entry Location Intelligence Engine (6.15.3.1)
//   - Evaluates current price location relative to entry zone
//   - Calculates entryDistance, entryDistanceATR
//   - Generates entryLocationScore (0-100)
//   - Generates entryLocationState (IDEAL/GOD/AWAY/EXTENDED)
// - Added debug display for Entry Location
//
// Repository:
// https://github.com/yueyh-123/CTS-Alpha
//=============================================================================

indicator(title = "CTS Alpha", shorttitle = "CTS", overlay = true, max_labels_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500, max_boxes_count = 200)

//=============================================================================
// 1. INPUT
//=============================================================================

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.1 General
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

groupGeneral = "General"
groupEMA = "EMA"
groupDebug = "Debug"
const string GROUP_ENGINE = "Engine"
const string GROUP_DISPLAY = "Display"
const string GROUP_DEBUG = "Debug"
const string GROUP_ADVANCED = "Advanced"

showEMA = input.bool(true, "Show EMA", group = groupGeneral)
showBackground = input.bool(true, "Background", group = groupGeneral)
debugMode = input.bool(false, "Debug Mode", group = groupDebug)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.2 EMA Settings
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

emaFastLength = input.int(20, "EMA Fast", minval = 1, step = 1, group = groupEMA)
emaMidLength = input.int(60, "EMA Middle", minval = 1, step = 1, group = groupEMA)
emaSlowLength = input.int(120, "EMA Slow", minval = 1, step = 1, group = groupEMA)
atrLength = input.int(14, "ATR Length", minval = 1, step = 1, group = groupGeneral)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.3 Pullback Settings
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

pullbackATR = input.float(1.0, "Pullback ATR", step = 0.1, group = GROUP_ENGINE)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.4 Slope Settings
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

slopeLookback = input.int(5, "Slope Lookback", minval = 2, maxval = 50, group = GROUP_ENGINE)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.5 Structure Settings
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

groupStructure = "Structure"
pivotLength = input.int(5, "Pivot Length", minval = 2, maxval = 20, group = groupStructure)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.6 Impulse Settings
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

impulseLookback = input.int(5, "Impulse Lookback", minval = 2, maxval = 20, group = GROUP_ENGINE)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.7 Compression Settings
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

compressionLookback = input.int(20, "Compression Lookback", minval = 10, maxval = 100, group = GROUP_ENGINE)
compressionATRThreshold = input.float(0.80, "ATR Compression", minval = 0.20, maxval = 2.00, step = 0.05, group = GROUP_ENGINE)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1.8 Breakout Settings
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

breakoutThreshold = input.float(60.0, "Breakout Threshold", minval = 30.0, maxval = 80.0, step = 5.0, group = GROUP_ENGINE)

//=============================================================================
// 2. CONSTANTS
//=============================================================================

TREND_STRONG = 90.0
TREND_HEALTHY = 75.0
TREND_WEAK = 60.0
TREND_NEUTRAL = 40.0

//=============================================================================
// 3. THEME
//=============================================================================

clrBull = color.rgb(34,197,94)
clrBear = color.rgb(239,68,68)
clrNeutral = color.rgb(156,163,175)
clrBullBG = color.new(clrBull,90)
clrBearBG = color.new(clrBear,90)

//=============================================================================
// 4. HELPER FUNCTIONS
//=============================================================================

clamp(value,minValue,maxValue)=> math.max(minValue,math.min(value,maxValue))
safeDivide(a,b)=> b==0.0?0.0:a/b
normalize(value,minValue,maxValue)=> maxValue==minValue?0.0: clamp((value-minValue)/(maxValue-minValue)*100.0,0.0,100.0)
normalizeSymmetric(value,maxAbs)=> clamp(((value+maxAbs)/(2.0*maxAbs))*100.0,0.0,100.0)
percentChange(current,previous)=> previous==0.0?0.0: (current-previous)/previous*100.0
roundScore(score)=> math.round(score*10.0)/10.0
scoreColor(score)=> score>=TREND_HEALTHY?clrBull:score<=TREND_NEUTRAL?clrBear:clrNeutral
scoreState(score)=> score>=90?"Bull Strong":score>=75?"Bull Healthy":score>=60?"Bull Weak":score>=40?"Neutral":score>=25?"Bear Weak":score>=10?"Bear Healthy":"Bear Strong"
scoreToState(score)=> score >= 90 ? "Ultra Bull" : score >= 80 ? "Strong Bull" : score >= 65 ? "Healthy Bull" : score >= 45 ? "Neutral" : score >= 25 ? "Healthy Bear" : score >= 10 ? "Strong Bear" : "Ultra Bear"
weightedScore(score, weight)=> score * weight
normalize01(value, maxValue) => maxValue == 0.0 ? 0.0 : clamp(value / maxValue, 0.0, 1.0)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Compression Helper
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

compressionLevel(value, threshold)=>
    clamp(
        (threshold - value) / threshold,
        0.0,
        1.0)

//=============================================================================
// 5. CONTEXT
//=============================================================================

ctxOpen = open
ctxHigh = high
ctxLow = low
ctxClose = close
ctxVolume = volume
ctxEMAFast = ta.ema(close,emaFastLength)
ctxEMAMid = ta.ema(close,emaMidLength)
ctxEMASlow = ta.ema(close,emaSlowLength)
ctxATR = ta.atr(atrLength)

//=============================================================================
// 6. ENGINES
//=============================================================================

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.1 Market Structure Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

ph = ta.pivothigh(high, pivotLength, pivotLength)
pl = ta.pivotlow(low, pivotLength, pivotLength)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Swing Cache
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

var float high1 = na
var float high2 = na
var float high3 = na
var float high4 = na
var float low1 = na
var float low2 = na
var float low3 = na
var float low4 = na

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Update Swing High
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

if not na(ph)
    high4 := high3
    high3 := high2
    high2 := high1
    high1 := ph

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Update Swing Low
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

if not na(pl)
    low4 := low3
    low3 := low2
    low2 := low1
    low1 := pl

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Swing Structure
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bool HH = not na(high2) and high1 > high2
bool LH = not na(high2) and high1 < high2
bool HL = not na(low2) and low1 > low2
bool LL = not na(low2) and low1 < low2
bool bullStructure = HH and HL
bool bearStructure = LH and LL

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Structure Score
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float engineStructureScore = 50.0
int bullCount = 0
int bearCount = 0
bullCount += HH ? 1 : 0
bullCount += HL ? 1 : 0
bearCount += LH ? 1 : 0
bearCount += LL ? 1 : 0
if bullCount == 2
    engineStructureScore := 100
else if bullCount == 1
    engineStructureScore := 75
else if bearCount == 2
    engineStructureScore := 0
else if bearCount == 1
    engineStructureScore := 25
else
    engineStructureScore := 50

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Structure State
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string structureState = engineStructureScore >= 75 ? "Bull" : engineStructureScore <= 25 ? "Bear" : "Range"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.2 Trend Alignment Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bool isBullAlignment = ctxEMAFast > ctxEMAMid and ctxEMAMid > ctxEMASlow
bool bearOrder = ctxEMAFast < ctxEMAMid and ctxEMAMid < ctxEMASlow
float fastMidGap = math.abs(ctxEMAFast - ctxEMAMid)
float midSlowGap = math.abs(ctxEMAMid - ctxEMASlow)
float gapAverage = (fastMidGap + midSlowGap) / 2.0
float gapStrength = normalize(safeDivide(gapAverage, ctxATR), 0.0, 2.0)
float trendAlignmentRaw = isBullAlignment ? gapStrength : bearOrder ? -gapStrength : 0.0
float engineAlignmentScore = isBullAlignment ? 50.0 + gapStrength * 50.0 : bearOrder ? 50.0 - gapStrength * 50.0 : 50.0
engineAlignmentScore := roundScore(clamp(engineAlignmentScore, 0.0, 100.0))
string trendAlignmentState = scoreToState(engineAlignmentScore)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.3 Trend Slope Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float emaSlopeRaw = ta.sma(ctxEMAFast - ctxEMAFast[1], slopeLookback)
float trendSlopeRaw = safeDivide(emaSlopeRaw, ctxATR)
float engineSlopeScore = roundScore(normalize(trendSlopeRaw, -0.50, 0.50))
string trendSlopeState = scoreToState(engineSlopeScore)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.4 Trend Composite Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float engineTrendScore = engineAlignmentScore * 0.35 + engineSlopeScore * 0.25 + engineStructureScore * 0.40
engineTrendScore := roundScore(engineTrendScore)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Trend State
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string trendState = scoreToState(engineTrendScore)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Trend Strength
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string trendStrength = engineTrendScore >= 90 ? "Extreme" : engineTrendScore >= 75 ? "Strong" : engineTrendScore >= 60 ? "Healthy" : engineTrendScore >= 40 ? "Weak" : "Bear"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.5 Impulse Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Price Expansion

float priceExpansionRaw = math.abs(ctxClose - ctxClose[impulseLookback])
float priceExpansionATR = safeDivide(priceExpansionRaw, ctxATR)
float priceExpansionScore = roundScore(normalize(priceExpansionATR, 0.0, 3.0))

// EMA Expansion

float emaExpansionRaw = math.abs(ctxEMAFast - ctxEMAFast[impulseLookback])
float emaExpansionATR = safeDivide(emaExpansionRaw, ctxATR)
float emaExpansionScore = roundScore(normalize(emaExpansionATR, 0.0, 2.0))

// Composite Score

float engineImpulseScore = (priceExpansionScore * 0.60 + emaExpansionScore * 0.40)
engineImpulseScore := roundScore(engineImpulseScore)

// State

string impulseState = engineImpulseScore >= 80 ? "Strong" : engineImpulseScore >= 60 ? "Healthy" : engineImpulseScore >= 40 ? "Weak" : "Dead"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.6 Compression Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Market Principle:
//
// Compression
//      ↓
// Expansion
//      ↓
// Trend
//      ↓
// Pullback
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ATR Compression

float atrCompressionRaw = safeDivide(ctxATR, ta.sma(ctxATR, compressionLookback))
float atrCompressionScore = roundScore(compressionLevel(atrCompressionRaw, compressionATRThreshold) * 100.0)

// EMA Compression

float emaSpread = math.abs(ctxEMAFast - ctxEMAMid) + math.abs(ctxEMAMid - ctxEMASlow)
float emaSpreadATR = safeDivide(emaSpread, ctxATR)
float emaCompressionScore = roundScore(normalize(2.0 - emaSpreadATR, 0.0, 2.0))

// Range Compression

float highestRange = ta.highest(high, compressionLookback)
float lowestRange = ta.lowest(low, compressionLookback)
float rangeATR = safeDivide(highestRange - lowestRange, ctxATR)
float rangeCompressionScore = roundScore(normalize(6.0 - rangeATR, 0.0, 6.0))

// Composite

float engineCompressionScore = atrCompressionScore * 0.40 + emaCompressionScore * 0.30 + rangeCompressionScore * 0.30
engineCompressionScore := roundScore(engineCompressionScore)

// State

string compressionState = engineCompressionScore >= 80 ? "Tight" : engineCompressionScore >= 60 ? "Normal" : engineCompressionScore >= 40 ? "Loose" : "Expanded"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.7 Volume Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float volumeMA = ta.sma(volume, 20)
float volumeRatio = safeDivide(volume, volumeMA)
float engineVolumeScore = roundScore(normalize(volumeRatio, 0.5, 2.0))

// Volume State

string volumeState = engineVolumeScore >= 80 ? "High" : engineVolumeScore >= 60 ? "Normal" : "Low"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.8 Market State Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Market State Machine:
//
// COMPRESSION
//      ↓
// BREAKOUT (Impulse + Trend)
//      ↓
// TRENDING
//      ↓
// PULLBACK
//      ↓
// RANGE / TRANSITION
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

// State Conditions

bool stateCompression = engineCompressionScore >= 75
bool stateTrend = engineTrendScore >= 70
bool stateImpulse = engineImpulseScore >= 70

// Pullback condition (calculated locally for engine independence)
float _emaDistance = math.abs(ctxClose - ctxEMAFast)
float _emaDistanceATR = safeDivide(_emaDistance, ctxATR)
bool _insidePullbackZone = _emaDistanceATR <= pullbackATR
bool statePullback = _insidePullbackZone and engineTrendScore >= 70

bool stateWeakTrend = engineTrendScore < 45

// Market State (order matters: BREAKOUT before TRENDING, PULLBACK before TRENDING)

string marketState = stateCompression ? "COMPRESSION" : (stateImpulse and stateTrend) ? "BREAKOUT" : statePullback ? "PULLBACK" : stateTrend ? "TRENDING" : stateWeakTrend ? "RANGE" : "TRANSITION"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// State Machine - Track Previous State
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

var string previousMarketState = "UNKNOWN"

// Detect state transitions
bool stateTransition = previousMarketState != marketState and previousMarketState != "UNKNOWN"

// Update previous state at bar confirmation
if barstate.isconfirmed
    previousMarketState := marketState

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// State Duration
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

var int stateDuration = 0

if stateTransition
    stateDuration := 1
else
    stateDuration += 1

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.9 Confidence Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Trend Confidence = Multi-factor confidence score
//
// Formula:
//   confidence = Trend x 0.5 + Impulse x 0.3 + (100 - Compression) x 0.2
//
// This captures three dimensions:
//   - Trend: Is there a directional bias?
//   - Impulse: Is momentum confirming the move?
//   - Compression Relief: Low compression = market is expanding
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float engineConfidenceScore = engineTrendScore * 0.50 + engineImpulseScore * 0.30 + (100.0 - engineCompressionScore) * 0.20
engineConfidenceScore := roundScore(clamp(engineConfidenceScore, 0.0, 100.0))

// Confidence State

string confidenceState = engineConfidenceScore >= 75 ? "High" : engineConfidenceScore >= 50 ? "Moderate" : engineConfidenceScore >= 25 ? "Low" : "Very Low"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.10 Breakout Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Breakout Probability = Multi-factor breakout detection
//
// Components:
//   - Compression: 35% (tight markets break out)
//   - Impulse: 35% (momentum confirms the break)
//   - Trend: 20% (trend direction supports breakout)
//   - Volume: 10% (volume confirmation)
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float breakoutRaw = engineCompressionScore * 0.35 + engineImpulseScore * 0.35 + engineTrendScore * 0.20 + engineVolumeScore * 0.10
float engineBreakoutScore = roundScore(breakoutRaw)

// Breakout State

string breakoutState = engineBreakoutScore >= breakoutThreshold + 20 ? "CONFIRMED" : engineBreakoutScore >= breakoutThreshold ? "EARLY" : "NONE"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.11 Direction Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Direction Engine
//
// Purpose:
// Determine market directional bias
//
// Factors:
//   - Trend Alignment 40%
//   - Structure 30%
//   - Momentum 20%
//   - EMA Position 10%
//
// Output:
// LONG / SHORT / NEUTRAL
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

// EMA Position

float emaPositionScore =
     ctxClose > ctxEMAFast and ctxEMAFast > ctxEMAMid ? 100.0 :
     ctxClose < ctxEMAFast and ctxEMAFast < ctxEMAMid ? 0.0 :
     50.0

// Direction Composite

float engineDirectionScore =
     engineAlignmentScore * 0.40 +
     engineStructureScore * 0.30 +
     engineImpulseScore * 0.20 +
     emaPositionScore * 0.10

engineDirectionScore := roundScore(clamp(engineDirectionScore, 0.0, 100.0))

// Direction State

string tradeDirection =
     engineDirectionScore >= 65 ? "LONG" :
     engineDirectionScore <= 35 ? "SHORT" :
     "NEUTRAL"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.12 Pullback Engine V2
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Pullback Quality Engine
//
// Purpose:
// Evaluate pullback quality continuously
//
// Components V2:
//
// Distance Quality   30%
// Trend Alignment    25%
// Structure Quality  30%
// Market Context     15%
//
// Output:
// 0 - 100
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

// EMA Distance
float emaDistance = math.abs(ctxClose - ctxEMAFast)
float emaDistanceATR = safeDivide(emaDistance, ctxATR)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. Distance Quality
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Ideal pullback:
// Close to EMA but not broken
//
// 0 ATR      = 100
// 0.5 ATR    = 90
// 1 ATR      = 70
// 1.5 ATR    = 40
// 2 ATR+     = 0
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float pbDistanceScore =
     emaDistanceATR <= 0.0 ? 100.0 :
     emaDistanceATR <= 0.5 ? 90.0 :
     emaDistanceATR <= 1.0 ? 70.0 :
     emaDistanceATR <= 1.5 ? 40.0 :
     0.0

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 2. Trend Alignment Quality
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Pullback should happen inside trend
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float pbTrendScore =
     engineTrendScore >= 75 ? 100.0 :
     engineTrendScore >= 50 ? 70.0 :
     engineTrendScore >= 25 ? 40.0 :
     0.0

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 3. Structure Quality
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Reuse Market Structure Engine
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float pbStructureScore = engineStructureScore

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 4. Market Context Quality
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Purpose:
//
// Evaluate whether current market environment
// supports a valid pullback.
//
// Strong trend:
// High confidence pullback
//
// Transition:
// Reduce pullback confidence
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float pullbackContextScore =
     marketState == "TRENDING" ? 100.0 :
     marketState == "PULLBACK" ? 90.0 :
     marketState == "BREAKOUT" ? 85.0 :
     marketState == "COMPRESSION" ? 60.0 :
     marketState == "TRANSITION" ? 50.0 :
     30.0

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Composite Pullback Quality V2
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Components:
//
// Distance Quality    30%
// Trend Alignment     25%
// Structure Quality   30%
// Market Context      15%
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float enginePullbackScore =
     pbDistanceScore * 0.30 +
     pbTrendScore * 0.25 +
     pbStructureScore * 0.30 +
     pullbackContextScore * 0.15

enginePullbackScore := roundScore(clamp(enginePullbackScore, 0.0, 100.0))

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Pullback State
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string pbState =
     enginePullbackScore >= 80 ? "HIGH QUALITY" :
     enginePullbackScore >= 60 ? "VALID" :
     enginePullbackScore >= 40 ? "WEAK" :
     "INVALID"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Pullback Validation Metrics
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Pullback Dominant Factor
string pbDominant =
     pbDistanceScore >= pbTrendScore and pbDistanceScore >= pbStructureScore ? "DISTANCE" :
     pbTrendScore >= pbDistanceScore and pbTrendScore >= pbStructureScore ? "TREND" :
     "STRUCTURE"

// Pullback Grade
string pbGrade =
     enginePullbackScore >= 80 and pullbackContextScore >= 80 ? "A" :
     enginePullbackScore >= 60 ? "B" :
     enginePullbackScore >= 40 ? "C" :
     "D"

// Pullback Trend Efficiency (formerly pbTrendRatio)
// Measures pullback quality relative to trend strength
// Clamped to 0-200% for meaningful display
float pbTrendEfficiency =
     engineTrendScore >= 40
     ? clamp(
          safeDivide(enginePullbackScore, engineTrendScore) * 100.0,
          0.0,
          200.0)
     : na

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Pullback Condition (Event Markers)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Keep original boolean signals for visual marking
// These are EVENT triggers, not quality scores
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bool healthyBullPullback =
     marketState == "TRENDING" and
     engineTrendScore >= 75 and
     ctxClose > ctxEMAMid and
     ctxClose < ctxEMAFast and
     enginePullbackScore >= 75

bool healthyBearPullback =
     marketState == "TRENDING" and
     engineTrendScore <= 25 and
     ctxClose < ctxEMAMid and
     ctxClose > ctxEMAFast and
     enginePullbackScore >= 75

bool insidePullbackZone = emaDistanceATR <= pullbackATR

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.13 Signal Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Signal Architecture:
//
// Market Context
//        ↓
// Direction Bias
//        ↓
// Signal Score
//        ↓
// Trading Readiness
//
// Components:
// Trend       40%
// Impulse     20%
// Breakout    20%
// Confidence  20%
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Direction Bias
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bool longBias =
     engineTrendScore >= 65 and
     engineStructureScore >= 50 and
     marketState != "RANGE" and
     engineConfidenceScore >= 50

bool shortBias =
     engineTrendScore <= 35 and
     engineStructureScore <= 50 and
     marketState != "RANGE" and
     engineConfidenceScore >= 50

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Signal Composite Score
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float engineSignalScore =
     engineTrendScore * 0.40 +
     engineImpulseScore * 0.20 +
     engineBreakoutScore * 0.20 +
     engineConfidenceScore * 0.20

engineSignalScore := roundScore(clamp(engineSignalScore, 0.0, 100.0))

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Signal State
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string signalState =
     engineSignalScore >= 75 ? "READY" :
     engineSignalScore >= 60 ? "SETUP" :
     engineSignalScore >= 40 ? "WATCH" :
     "NO TRADE"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Signal Direction
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string signalDirection =
     longBias ? "LONG" :
     shortBias ? "SHORT" :
     "NEUTRAL"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.14 Risk Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Risk Engine
//
// Purpose:
// Evaluate trade environment quality
//
// Components:
//
// Confidence        40%
// Trend Stability   30%
// Compression Safety20%
// Volume            10%
//
// Output:
// LOW RISK
// MEDIUM RISK
// HIGH RISK
// AVOID
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float engineRiskScore = engineConfidenceScore * 0.40 + engineTrendScore * 0.30 + (100.0 - engineCompressionScore) * 0.20 + engineVolumeScore * 0.10
engineRiskScore := roundScore(clamp(engineRiskScore, 0.0, 100.0))

// Risk State

string riskState =
     engineRiskScore >= 80 ? "LOW RISK" :
     engineRiskScore >= 60 ? "MEDIUM RISK" :
     engineRiskScore >= 40 ? "HIGH RISK" :
     "AVOID"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.15 Entry Engine V4
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Entry Engine V4
//
// Purpose:
// Evaluate if current price is a good entry position
//
// Entry Quality V4 =
//   Trend Quality       20%
// + Pullback Quality    20%
// + Location Quality    25%
// + Momentum Quality    15%
// + Context Alignment   20%
//
// Output:
// IDEAL ENTRY   (>=85 + Context >= 80 + Location >= 70)
// GOOD ENTRY    (>=70 + Context >= 60 + Location >= 50)
// WAIT BETTER PRICE (Location < 50)
// WAIT PULLBACK (>=50)
// OVEREXTENDED  (>=30)
// NO ENTRY      (<30)
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Trend Quality (20%)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float entryTrendScore = engineTrendScore

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Pullback Quality (20%)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float entryPullbackScore =
     healthyBullPullback or healthyBearPullback ? 100.0 :
     insidePullbackZone ? 70.0 :
     40.0

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Position Quality (Retained for Risk Engine compatibility)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// This variable is kept for backward compatibility
// with Risk Engine and other modules.
//
// Not used in Entry Score V4.
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float entryPositionScore =
     emaDistanceATR <= 0.5 ? 100.0 :
     emaDistanceATR <= 1.0 ? 80.0 :
     emaDistanceATR <= 1.5 ? 50.0 :
     emaDistanceATR <= 2.0 ? 20.0 :
     0.0

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Momentum Exhaustion Engine (15%)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Purpose:
//
// Detect excessive short-term expansion.
//
// Prevent chasing strong moves.
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float bullishBarCount = math.sum(close > close[1] ? 1 : 0, 5)

float entryMomentumScore =
     priceExpansionATR > 2.0 and bullishBarCount >= 4 ? 30.0 :
     priceExpansionATR > 1.5 ? 50.0 :
     80.0

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Entry Context Alignment (20%)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Evaluate whether current market environment
// supports entry execution.
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float entryContextScore =
     marketState == "TRENDING" ? 100.0 :
     marketState == "PULLBACK" ? 90.0 :
     marketState == "BREAKOUT" ? 85.0 :
     marketState == "COMPRESSION" ? 60.0 :
     marketState == "TRANSITION" ? 50.0 :
     30.0

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Impulse Alignment (15% weight component)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Measure whether market has enough impulse
// to support execution.
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float entryImpulseScore =
     engineImpulseScore >= 70 ? 100.0 :
     engineImpulseScore >= 40 ? 70.0 :
     engineImpulseScore >= 20 ? 50.0 :
     30.0

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Structure Entry Price Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Calculate execution price zone
//
// Based on:
// EMA20 + EMA60 pullback area
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float entryStructurePrice =
     (ctxEMAFast + ctxEMAMid) / 2

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Direction Adaptive Entry Price Adjustment (Task 007.3.2)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Purpose:
// Adjust entry price based on trade direction.
//
// LONG:
//   Buy on pullback → price below structure
//   Entry = StructurePrice - Adjustment
//
// SHORT:
//   Sell on rally → price above structure
//   Entry = StructurePrice + Adjustment
//
// NEUTRAL:
//   No direction → neutral price
//   Entry = StructurePrice
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Base adjustment from Position Score
float baseAdjustment =
     entryPositionScore >= 80 ? 0.0 :
     entryPositionScore >= 60 ? ctxATR * 0.25 :
     ctxATR * 0.5

// Direction Adaptive Entry Price
float engineEntryPrice =
     tradeDirection == "LONG"
          ? entryStructurePrice - baseAdjustment
          : tradeDirection == "SHORT"
               ? entryStructurePrice + baseAdjustment
               : entryStructurePrice

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.15.3.1 Entry Location Intelligence Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Purpose:
//
// Evaluate current price location
// relative to calculated entry zone.
//
// Question:
//
// "Is current price close enough
//  to execute?"
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Entry Distance
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Distance between current price
// and engine calculated entry price
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float entryDistance =
     math.abs(ctxClose - engineEntryPrice)


float entryDistanceATR =
     safeDivide(entryDistance, ctxATR)


//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Entry Location Score
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Ideal:
// Close to Entry Zone
//
// Bad:
// Price extended away
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float entryLocationScore =
     entryDistanceATR <= 0.5 ? 100.0 :
     entryDistanceATR <= 1.0 ? 80.0 :
     entryDistanceATR <= 1.5 ? 50.0 :
     entryDistanceATR <= 2.0 ? 25.0 :
     0.0


entryLocationScore :=
     roundScore(
          clamp(
               entryLocationScore,
               0.0,
               100.0
          )
     )


//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Entry Location State
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string entryLocationState =
     entryLocationScore >= 85 ? "IDEAL ZONE" :
     entryLocationScore >= 60 ? "GOOD ZONE" :
     entryLocationScore >= 30 ? "AWAY FROM ZONE" :
     "EXTENDED"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Entry Score Calculation V4
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Components:
//
// Trend Quality       20%
// Pullback Quality    20%
// Location Quality    25%
// Momentum Quality    15%
// Context Alignment   20%
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float engineEntryScore =
     entryTrendScore * 0.20 +
     entryPullbackScore * 0.20 +
     entryLocationScore * 0.25 +
     entryMomentumScore * 0.15 +
     entryContextScore * 0.20

engineEntryScore := roundScore(clamp(engineEntryScore, 0.0, 100.0))

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Trend Gate
// Weak trend cannot generate valid entry
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

if engineTrendScore < 40
    engineEntryScore := 0

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Entry State V4
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string entryState = "NO ENTRY"

if engineEntryScore >= 85 and 
   entryContextScore >= 80 and
   entryLocationScore >= 70

    entryState := "IDEAL ENTRY"

else if engineEntryScore >= 70 and entryContextScore >= 60 and entryLocationScore >= 50

    entryState := "GOOD ENTRY"

else if entryLocationScore < 50

    entryState := "WAIT BETTER PRICE"

else if engineEntryScore >= 50

    entryState := "WAIT PULLBACK"

else if engineEntryScore >= 30

    entryState := "OVEREXTENDED"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.15.4 Structure Direction Alignment Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Purpose:
//
// Evaluate whether market structure
// supports current trading direction.
//
// Bull Structure + LONG
// Bear Structure + SHORT
// = Alignment
//
// Conflict:
// Bull Structure + SHORT
// Bear Structure + LONG
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float engineStructureDirectionScore =
     engineStructureScore >= 75 and tradeDirection == "LONG" ? 100.0 :
     engineStructureScore <= 25 and tradeDirection == "SHORT" ? 100.0 :
     engineStructureScore >= 75 and tradeDirection == "SHORT" ? 25.0 :
     engineStructureScore <= 25 and tradeDirection == "LONG" ? 25.0 :
     50.0

string structureDirectionState =
     engineStructureDirectionScore >= 80 ? "ALIGNED" :
     engineStructureDirectionScore <= 30 ? "CONFLICT" :
     "MIXED"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.15.5 Decision Foundation Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Purpose:
//
// Build decision foundation layers.
//
// Layer 1:
// Market Quality
//
// Layer 2:
// Opportunity Quality
//
// Layer 3:
// Execution Quality
//
// Architecture:
//
// Market
//    ↓
// Opportunity
//    ↓
// Execution
//    ↓
// Decision
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Market Quality Score
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Evaluate overall market environment.
//
// Components:
//
// Trend        40%
// Structure    30%
// Confidence  20%
// Volume       10%
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float engineMarketScore =
     engineTrendScore * 0.40 +
     engineStructureScore * 0.30 +
     engineConfidenceScore * 0.20 +
     engineVolumeScore * 0.10

engineMarketScore := roundScore(clamp(engineMarketScore,0.0,100.0))


//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Market Quality State
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string marketQualityState =
     engineMarketScore >= 85 ? "EXCELLENT" :
     engineMarketScore >= 70 ? "GOOD" :
     engineMarketScore >= 50 ? "FAIR" :
     "POOR"


//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// State Quality Score
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Market state contribution.
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float stateQualityScore =
     marketState == "BREAKOUT" ? 90.0 :
     marketState == "TRENDING" ? 80.0 :
     marketState == "PULLBACK" ? 85.0 :
     marketState == "COMPRESSION" ? 60.0 :
     marketState == "TRANSITION" ? 40.0 :
     20.0


//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Opportunity Quality Score
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Components:
//
// Breakout      30%
// Pullback      30%
// Impulse       20%
// State Quality 20%
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float engineOpportunityScore =
     engineBreakoutScore * 0.30 +
     enginePullbackScore * 0.30 +
     engineImpulseScore * 0.20 +
     stateQualityScore * 0.20

engineOpportunityScore := roundScore(clamp(engineOpportunityScore,0.0,100.0))


//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Opportunity State
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string opportunityState =
     engineOpportunityScore >= 80 ? "HIGH" :
     engineOpportunityScore >= 60 ? "MEDIUM" :
     "LOW"


//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Direction Quality Score
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// The farther Direction Score is from neutral 50,
// the stronger the directional bias.
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float directionQualityScore =
     math.abs(engineDirectionScore - 50.0) * 2.0

directionQualityScore :=
     roundScore(clamp(directionQualityScore,0.0,100.0))


//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Execution Quality Score (Modified Commit 0032.0)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Components:
//
// Entry Quality            40%
// Risk Quality             25%
// Direction Quality        20%
// Structure Direction Align 15%
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float engineExecutionScore =
     engineEntryScore * 0.40 +
     engineRiskScore * 0.25 +
     directionQualityScore * 0.20 +
     engineStructureDirectionScore * 0.15

engineExecutionScore :=
     roundScore(clamp(engineExecutionScore,0.0,100.0))


//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Execution State
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string executionQualityState =
     engineExecutionScore >= 80 ? "READY" :
     engineExecutionScore >= 60 ? "ACCEPTABLE" :
     engineExecutionScore >= 40 ? "WEAK" :
     "BLOCKED"

//=============================================================================
// 6.15.6 TRADE MODE ENGINE (Commit 0034.0)
//=============================================================================
//
// Trade Mode Engine
//
// Purpose:
// Separate trade mode detection from Decision Engine
//
// Decision Stage:
// - WAIT  : No setup detected
// - WATCH : Setup exists, waiting for momentum/impulse confirmation
// - READY : Setup confirmed, ready for decision
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Trade Mode Engine - Core Variables
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string tradeMode = "NONE"
string decisionStage = "WAIT"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Trade Mode Conditions
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

// pullbackSetup = Opportunity exists (trend + direction + structure + grade)
bool pullbackSetup =
     engineTrendScore >= 70 and
     engineDirectionScore >= 70 and
     engineStructureDirectionScore >= 70 and
     (pbGrade == "A" or pbGrade == "B")

// pullbackReady = Setup + Momentum/Impulse confirmation
bool pullbackReady =
     pullbackSetup and
     (
         engineImpulseScore >= 40 or
         entryMomentumScore >= 60
     )

// breakoutReady = Breakout score + Volume confirmation
bool breakoutReady =
     engineBreakoutScore >= breakoutThreshold and
     engineVolumeScore >= 50

//=============================================================================
// 6.16 DECISION ENGINE
//=============================================================================
//
// Decision = Direction + Signal + Confidence + Breakout + Entry
// Output : BUY NOW / BUY READY / WAIT / SELL READY / SELL NOW / AVOID
//
// Modified Commit 0034.0:
// - Trade Mode Selection V2 (BREAKOUT → READY, PULLBACK + Momentum → READY, PULLBACK → WATCH)
// - decisionApproved uses decisionStage == "READY"
// - decisionReason now displays stage-specific reasons
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Trade Mode Selection V2
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

if breakoutReady
    tradeMode := "BREAKOUT"
    decisionStage := "READY"

else if pullbackReady
    tradeMode := "PULLBACK"
    decisionStage := "READY"

else if pullbackSetup
    tradeMode := "PULLBACK"
    decisionStage := "WATCH"

else
    tradeMode := "NONE"
    decisionStage := "WAIT"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Decision Approval (Modified Commit 0034.0)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Now uses decisionStage == "READY" instead of pullbackMode or breakoutMode
//
// Effect:
//   decisionStage == "READY" → Decision can approve
//   decisionStage == "WATCH" → Wait for momentum confirmation
//   decisionStage == "WAIT"  → No setup
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bool decisionApproved =
     decisionStage == "READY"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Composite Decision Score V2
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Market Quality      40%
// Opportunity Quality 35%
// Execution Quality   25%

float engineDecisionScore =
     engineMarketScore * 0.40 +
     engineOpportunityScore * 0.35 +
     engineExecutionScore * 0.25

engineDecisionScore :=
     roundScore(clamp(engineDecisionScore,0.0,100.0))

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Decision Quality Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Purpose:
// Map Decision Score to qualitative rating
//
// Mapping:
// 85-100 → EXCELLENT
// 70-85  → GOOD
// 50-70  → FAIR
// 30-50  → POOR
// 0-30   → BAD
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string decisionQuality =
     engineDecisionScore >= 85 ? "EXCELLENT" :
     engineDecisionScore >= 70 ? "GOOD" :
     engineDecisionScore >= 50 ? "FAIR" :
     engineDecisionScore >= 30 ? "POOR" :
     "BAD"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Direction Explain Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Purpose:
// Explain why Direction Engine returns NEUTRAL
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string directionReason = "Neutral"

if engineAlignmentScore > 60 and engineStructureScore >= 75
    directionReason := "Trend Developing"

else if engineAlignmentScore < 40
    directionReason := "EMA Alignment Weak"

else if engineStructureScore >= 75
    directionReason := "Structure Leading"

else
    directionReason := "Mixed Signal"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Decision State
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string decisionState = "WAIT"

// Strong Long
if marketState != "RANGE" and tradeDirection == "LONG" and engineMarketScore >= 85 and engineOpportunityScore >= 80 and engineExecutionScore >= 80 and decisionApproved
    decisionState := "BUY NOW"

// Long Setup
else if marketState != "RANGE" and tradeDirection == "LONG" and engineMarketScore >= 70 and engineOpportunityScore >= 60 and engineExecutionScore >= 60 and decisionApproved
    decisionState := "BUY READY"

// Strong Short
else if marketState != "RANGE" and tradeDirection == "SHORT" and engineMarketScore >= 85 and engineOpportunityScore >= 80 and engineExecutionScore >= 80 and decisionApproved
    decisionState := "SELL NOW"

// Short Setup
else if marketState != "RANGE" and tradeDirection == "SHORT" and engineMarketScore >= 70 and engineOpportunityScore >= 60 and engineExecutionScore >= 60 and decisionApproved
    decisionState := "SELL READY"

// Avoid Range
else if marketState == "RANGE" and engineCompressionScore < 50
    decisionState := "AVOID"

// Default
else
    decisionState := "WAIT"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.16.1 Decision Explain Engine (Modified Commit 0034.1)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Purpose:
//
// Explain why Decision Engine blocks execution.
//
// Priority (Fixed in 0034.1):
//
// 1. Range Market
// 2. Direction Neutral
// 3. Trend Too Weak
// 4. Entry Quality Too Low
// 5. Trade Mode Stage (WATCH / READY)  ← MOVED UP
// 6. Breakout Missing (only if NOT in Pullback Mode)
// 7. Confidence Too Low
// 8. Structure Direction Conflict
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string decisionReason = "Ready"
string decisionDetailReason = ""

// 1. Execution disabled by market state

if decisionState == "AVOID"
    decisionReason := "Range Market"

// 2. Direction not clear

else if tradeDirection == "NEUTRAL"
    decisionReason := "Direction Neutral"
    decisionDetailReason := directionReason

// 3. Trend insufficient

else if engineTrendScore < 40
    decisionReason := "Trend Too Weak"

// 4. Entry quality insufficient

else if engineEntryScore < 60
    decisionReason := "Entry Quality Too Low"

// 5. TRADE MODE STAGE SPECIFIC REASONS (MOVED UP - Fix Commit 0034.1)
// These now take priority over Breakout Missing

else if tradeMode == "PULLBACK" and decisionStage == "WATCH"
    decisionReason := "Waiting Momentum Confirmation"

else if tradeMode == "PULLBACK" and decisionStage == "READY"
    decisionReason := "Trend Pullback Setup"

else if tradeMode == "BREAKOUT" and decisionStage == "READY"
    decisionReason := "Breakout Confirmation"

// 6. Breakout not confirmed (only if NOT in Pullback Mode)
// MOVED DOWN - Now after Trade Mode Stage check

else if tradeMode != "PULLBACK" and breakoutState == "NONE"
    decisionReason := "Waiting Breakout"

// 7. Confidence insufficient

else if engineConfidenceScore < 50
    decisionReason := "Confidence Too Low"

// 8. Structure Direction Conflict

else if engineStructureDirectionScore <= 30
    decisionReason := "Structure Direction Conflict"

// Waiting

else if decisionState == "WAIT" and tradeMode == "NONE"
    decisionReason := "Waiting Setup"

// Ready

else
    decisionReason := "Ready"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.16.2 Next Action Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Purpose:
//
// Recommend the next trading action.
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string nextAction = "Monitor Market"

// Ready

if decisionState == "BUY NOW"
    nextAction := "Execute Long"

else if decisionState == "SELL NOW"
    nextAction := "Execute Short"

else if decisionState == "BUY READY"
    nextAction := "Prepare Long Entry"

else if decisionState == "SELL READY"
    nextAction := "Prepare Short Entry"

// Waiting

else if decisionReason == "Waiting Breakout"
    nextAction := "Monitor Breakout"

else if decisionReason == "Entry Quality Too Low"
    nextAction := "Wait Pullback"

else if decisionReason == "Trend Too Weak"
    nextAction := "Wait Trend Recovery"

else if decisionReason == "Direction Neutral"
    nextAction := "Wait Direction Confirmation"

else if decisionReason == "Confidence Too Low"
    nextAction := "Reduce Risk"

else if decisionReason == "Range Market"
    nextAction := "Stay Out"

else if decisionReason == "Structure Direction Conflict"
    nextAction := "Wait Structure Realignment"

// Trade Mode stage specific
// Added "Waiting Momentum Confirmation" - Fix Commit 0034.1
else if decisionReason == "Waiting Momentum Confirmation"
    nextAction := "Wait Momentum Recovery"

else if decisionReason == "Trend Pullback Setup"
    nextAction := "Ready for Pullback Entry"

else if decisionReason == "Breakout Confirmation"
    nextAction := "Ready for Breakout Entry"

// Default

else
    nextAction := "Monitor Market"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.16.3 Next Trigger Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Purpose:
//
// Define specific trigger conditions for Next Action.
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string nextTrigger = "None"

if decisionReason == "Direction Neutral" and engineStructureScore >= 75
    nextTrigger := "EMA Fast > EMA Mid > EMA Slow"

else if decisionReason == "Direction Neutral" and engineStructureScore < 75
    nextTrigger := "Direction Signal Confirmation"

else if decisionReason == "Entry Quality Too Low"
    nextTrigger := "Price Return EMA20 Zone"

else if decisionReason == "Waiting Breakout"
    nextTrigger := "Breakout Score > " + str.tostring(breakoutThreshold)

else if decisionReason == "Trend Too Weak"
    nextTrigger := "Trend Score > 60"

else if decisionReason == "Confidence Too Low"
    nextTrigger := "Confidence Score > 50"

else if decisionReason == "Range Market"
    nextTrigger := "Compression or Breakout"

else if decisionReason == "Structure Direction Conflict"
    nextTrigger := "Structure Score Aligns with Direction"

else if decisionReason == "Waiting Setup"
    nextTrigger := "Decision Score > 60"

else if decisionReason == "Waiting Momentum Confirmation"
    nextTrigger := "Impulse Score ≥ 40 OR Momentum Score ≥ 60"

else if decisionReason == "Trend Pullback Setup"
    nextTrigger := "Price at EMA Zone"

else if decisionReason == "Breakout Confirmation"
    nextTrigger := "Breakout Confirmed"

else if decisionReason == "Ready"
    nextTrigger := "Monitor Execution"

else
    nextTrigger := "No Trigger"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.16.4 Execution Guard Engine V1
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Purpose:
//
// Execution Guard is the execution-permission layer between
// Decision Engine and Trade Setup Engine.
//
// IMPORTANT ARCHITECTURE RULE:
// - Engines calculate quality.
// - Decision Engine evaluates opportunity.
// - Execution Guard evaluates execution permission.
// - Execution Guard does NOT recalculate market quality.
//
// Current V1 gates:
// 1. Decision Gate
// 2. Direction Gate
// 3. Structure Gate
// 4. Risk Gate
// 5. Entry Gate
//
// Patch 4 preparation:
// - Entry Location Intelligence remains inside Entry Engine V4.
// - Risk Intelligence remains inside Risk Engine.
// - Entry Location is promoted to an explicit execution gate in Task 008.2.
// - Risk Intelligence is promoted to an explicit execution gate in Task 008.3.
//
// Compatibility:
// - executionGate remains ALLOW / BLOCK because Trade Setup Engine
//   already consumes executionGate.
// - executionState is the new semantic execution status.
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Execution Guard State Variables
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Legacy binary interface consumed by Trade Setup Engine.
string executionGate = "BLOCK"

// Semantic execution state.
// APPROVE      = execution is approved
// CONDITIONAL  = execution requires additional condition
// WAIT         = setup exists but confirmation is missing
// BLOCK        = execution is prohibited
string executionState = "BLOCK"

string executionBlockReason = "NONE"
string executionDetailReason = "NONE"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Individual Gate Evaluation
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bool gateDecisionOK =
     decisionState == "BUY NOW" or
     decisionState == "BUY READY" or
     decisionState == "SELL NOW" or
     decisionState == "SELL READY"

bool gateDirectionOK =
     tradeDirection == "LONG" or
     tradeDirection == "SHORT"

bool gateStructureOK =
     engineStructureDirectionScore >= 50

// Risk Gate V1 (Task 008.3)
//
// PASS:
// - LOW RISK
//
// CONDITIONAL:
// - MEDIUM RISK
//
// BLOCK:
// - HIGH RISK
// - AVOID
//
// Risk Score remains a quality/risk measure.
// Risk Gate converts that intelligence into execution permission.
// MEDIUM RISK is diagnostic/conditional only and does not independently
// grant execution permission in Task 008.3.
//
string riskIntelligenceGateState =
     riskState == "LOW RISK" ? "PASS" :
     riskState == "MEDIUM RISK" ? "CONDITIONAL" :
     "BLOCK"

bool gateRiskOK =
     riskIntelligenceGateState == "PASS"

bool gateRiskConditional =
     riskIntelligenceGateState == "CONDITIONAL"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Entry Location Gate V1 (Task 008.2)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// PASS:
// - IDEAL/GOOD ENTRY
// - Location Score >= 60
// - Entry Distance <= 1.5 ATR
//
// CONDITIONAL:
// - IDEAL/GOOD ENTRY
// - Location Score >= 50
// - Entry Distance <= 2.0 ATR
//
// BLOCK:
// - Invalid entry state
// - Location Score < 50
// - Entry Distance > 2.0 ATR
//
// Entry Score remains a quality score.
// Entry Location Gate is an execution constraint.
// CONDITIONAL does not grant execution permission in Task 008.2.
//
string entryLocationGateState =
     (entryState == "IDEAL ENTRY" or entryState == "GOOD ENTRY") and
     entryLocationScore >= 60 and
     entryDistanceATR <= 1.5
     ? "PASS" :
     (entryState == "IDEAL ENTRY" or entryState == "GOOD ENTRY") and
     entryLocationScore >= 50 and
     entryDistanceATR <= 2.0
     ? "CONDITIONAL" :
     "BLOCK"

bool gateEntryOK =
     entryLocationGateState == "PASS"

bool gateEntryConditional =
     entryLocationGateState == "CONDITIONAL"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Gate Diagnostics
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Entry Gate now evaluates Entry Location + Entry Distance.
// Conditional is diagnostic only and does not independently allow execution.
//
string decisionGateState =
     gateDecisionOK ? "PASS" : "BLOCK"

string directionGateState =
     gateDirectionOK ? "PASS" : "BLOCK"

string structureGateState =
     gateStructureOK ? "PASS" : "BLOCK"

string riskGateState =
     riskIntelligenceGateState

string entryGateState =
     entryLocationGateState

int executionGatePassedCount =
     (gateDecisionOK ? 1 : 0) +
     (gateDirectionOK ? 1 : 0) +
     (gateStructureOK ? 1 : 0) +
     (gateRiskOK ? 1 : 0) +
     (gateEntryOK ? 1 : 0)

int executionGateConditionalCount =
     (gateEntryConditional ? 1 : 0) +
     (gateRiskConditional ? 1 : 0)

int executionGateTotalCount = 5

// Final Execution Decision V1 (Task 008.4)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Core Principle:
// Execution Guard is the final arbitration layer.
// It does not recalculate market scores.
// It only resolves the existing gate states into one execution decision.
//
// Gate hierarchy:
// 1. Hard Block  -> BLOCK
// 2. Decision WAIT -> WAIT
// 3. Conditional Risk/Entry -> CONDITIONAL
// 4. All gates PASS -> APPROVE
//
// Legacy interface:
// - executionGate remains ALLOW / BLOCK.
// - executionAllowed continues to consume executionGate.
//
// Semantic interface:
// - executionState = APPROVE / CONDITIONAL / WAIT / BLOCK
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bool gateHardBlock =
     not gateDirectionOK or
     not gateStructureOK or
     riskIntelligenceGateState == "BLOCK" or
     entryLocationGateState == "BLOCK"

bool gateAnyConditional =
     gateRiskConditional or
     gateEntryConditional

executionGate := "BLOCK"
executionState := "BLOCK"
executionBlockReason := "NONE"
executionDetailReason := "NONE"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Final Arbitration
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

if gateHardBlock

    executionGate := "BLOCK"
    executionState := "BLOCK"

    if not gateDirectionOK

        executionBlockReason := "Direction Blocked"

        executionDetailReason :=
             "Direction " +
             tradeDirection +
             " | Score " +
             str.tostring(engineDirectionScore)

    else if not gateStructureOK

        executionBlockReason := "Structure Conflict"

        executionDetailReason :=
             structureDirectionState

    else if riskIntelligenceGateState == "BLOCK"

        executionBlockReason := "Risk Blocked"

        executionDetailReason :=
             riskState +
             " | Risk Score " +
             str.tostring(engineRiskScore)

    else

        executionBlockReason := "Entry Location Blocked"

        executionDetailReason :=
             entryState +
             " | Location " +
             str.tostring(entryLocationScore) +
             " | Distance " +
             str.tostring(entryDistanceATR) +
             " ATR"

else if not gateDecisionOK

    executionGate := "BLOCK"

    executionState :=
         decisionState == "WAIT"
         ? "WAIT"
         : "BLOCK"

    executionBlockReason :=
         decisionState == "WAIT"
         ? "Decision Waiting"
         : "Decision Not Approved"

    executionDetailReason :=
         decisionState +
         " | Score " +
         str.tostring(engineDecisionScore)

else if gateAnyConditional

    executionGate := "BLOCK"
    executionState := "CONDITIONAL"

    if gateRiskConditional and gateEntryConditional

        executionBlockReason := "Risk + Entry Conditional"

        executionDetailReason :=
             riskState +
             " | Risk " +
             str.tostring(engineRiskScore) +
             " | Entry " +
             entryState +
             " | Location " +
             str.tostring(entryLocationScore)

    else if gateRiskConditional

        executionBlockReason := "Risk Conditional"

        executionDetailReason :=
             riskState +
             " | Risk Score " +
             str.tostring(engineRiskScore)

    else

        executionBlockReason := "Entry Location Conditional"

        executionDetailReason :=
             entryState +
             " | Location " +
             str.tostring(entryLocationScore) +
             " | Distance " +
             str.tostring(entryDistanceATR) +
             " ATR"

else

    executionGate := "ALLOW"
    executionState := "APPROVE"
    executionBlockReason := "All Conditions Passed"
    executionDetailReason := "All 5 Gates Passed"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Final Execution Permission
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Only APPROVE may reach the Trade Setup Engine.
// CONDITIONAL / WAIT / BLOCK remain execution-blocked.
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Execution Guard Summary
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

string executionGateSummary =
     str.tostring(executionGatePassedCount) +
     "/" +
     str.tostring(executionGateTotalCount) +
     " GATES PASSED"

// 6.17 Trade Setup Engine
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Trade Setup Engine
//
// Purpose:
// Generate execution plan after Decision Engine confirmation
//
// Output:
// Entry Price
// Stop Loss
// Take Profit
// Risk Reward Ratio
//
// v0.9.6 Commit 0033.0
//
// Execution Guard Integration:
// - executionAllowed now requires final executionGate == "ALLOW" and executionState == "APPROVE"
// - Complete flow: Decision → Gate Arbitration → Guard → Trade Setup
// - BUY READY / BUY NOW / SELL READY / SELL NOW → filtered by Guard
// - WAIT / AVOID → NA for all fields
//
// Direction Guard:
// - LONG  → valid Long Plan (Stop = Entry - 2ATR, Target = Entry + 4ATR)
// - SHORT → valid Short Plan (Stop = Entry + 2ATR, Target = Entry - 4ATR)
// - NEUTRAL → no Plan (Stop = na, Target = na, RR = na)
//
// Integration (Task 007.3.3):
// - tradeEntryPrice now uses engineEntryPrice instead of close
// - Complete flow: Decision → Entry Engine → Trade Setup → Risk
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Trade Setup Parameters

float tradeRRTarget = 2.0

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Execution Guard Interface
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// executionAllowed = Execution Guard output
//
// Guard filters Decision approval before Trade Setup generation.
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bool executionAllowed =
     executionGate == "ALLOW" and
     executionState == "APPROVE"

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Entry Price (Task 007.3.3)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// Now uses engineEntryPrice instead of close
//
// Complete integration:
// Decision Engine → Entry Engine → Execution Guard → Trade Setup
//
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float tradeEntryPrice =
     executionAllowed
          ? engineEntryPrice
          : na

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Stop Loss
// Direction Guard + Execution Guard
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float tradeATR = ta.atr(14)

float tradeStopLoss =
     executionAllowed
     ? tradeDirection == "LONG"
          ? tradeEntryPrice - tradeATR * 2.0
          : tradeDirection == "SHORT"
               ? tradeEntryPrice + tradeATR * 2.0
               : na
     : na

// Risk Distance

float tradeRiskDistance = not na(tradeStopLoss) ? math.abs(tradeEntryPrice - tradeStopLoss) : na

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Take Profit
// Direction Guard + Execution Guard
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float tradeTarget =
     executionAllowed
     ? tradeDirection == "LONG"
          ? tradeEntryPrice + tradeRiskDistance * tradeRRTarget
          : tradeDirection == "SHORT"
               ? tradeEntryPrice - tradeRiskDistance * tradeRRTarget
               : na
     : na

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Risk Reward
// Returns na when Execution not allowed or NEUTRAL
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

float tradeRiskReward =
     executionAllowed and
     tradeRiskDistance > 0 and
     not na(tradeTarget)
     ? math.abs(tradeTarget - tradeEntryPrice) / tradeRiskDistance
     : na


//=============================================================================
// 7. DISPLAY
//=============================================================================

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 7.1 EMAs
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

plot(showEMA ? ctxEMAFast : na, title = "EMA Fast", color = color.green, linewidth = 2)
plot(showEMA ? ctxEMAMid : na, title = "EMA Middle", color = color.orange, linewidth = 2)
plot(showEMA ? ctxEMASlow : na, title = "EMA Slow", color = color.red, linewidth = 2)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 7.2 Background
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

bgcolor(showBackground ? color.new(scoreColor(engineTrendScore), 90) : na)

//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 7.3 Pullback Shapes
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

plotshape(healthyBullPullback, title = "Bull Pullback", style = shape.circle, location = location.belowbar, color = color.lime, size = size.tiny)
plotshape(healthyBearPullback, title = "Bear Pullback", style = shape.circle, location = location.abovebar, color = color.red, size = size.tiny)

